IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `snap-core`
IMPORT `snap3-logic`

-- SECTION 2023, ADMINISTRATIVE AND JUDICIAL REVIEW; RESTORATION OF RIGHTS (7 U.S.C. 2023): lines 1859-1882 of usc07-ch51.txt.
-- Layer 1: the law, objectively. A function answers MAYBE BOOLEAN (or MAYBE DATE, MAYBE Party) with: JUST TRUE = the text says yes;
-- JUST FALSE = the text says no in its own words; NOTHING = the text does not say.
-- A duty without a stated time is answered "has done": JUST TRUE if done, NOTHING if not.
-- Days are whole days counted from the date the text names, the date itself not counted; "within ten days" includes the tenth day (NOTES.md, fork F-2023-2).
-- Source is a converter's plain-text rendering, not the official text.

-- THE ACTIONS paragraph (1) lists, each of which must be notified.
DECLARE `s 2023(a)(1) administrative action` IS ONE OF
    `s 2023(a)(1) denial of an application of a retail food store or wholesale food concern to participate, under section 2018`
    `s 2023(a)(1) disqualification or a civil money penalty under section 2021`
    `s 2023(a)(1) forfeiture of a bond under section 2021(d)`
    `s 2023(a)(1) denial of all or part of a claim of a retail food store or wholesale food concern under section 2022`
    `s 2023(a)(1) a claim against a State agency stated under section 2022`
    `s 2023(a)(1) any other action`

-- HOW A COURT REVIEWS: paragraph (15).
DECLARE `s 2023(a)(15) standard of review` IS ONE OF
    `s 2023(a)(15) trial de novo`
    `s 2023(a)(15) review on the administrative record`

§ `s 2023 -- administrative and judicial review; restoration of rights`

§§ `s 2023(a) paragraphs (1) to (5) notice and the request for review`

-- src:1861 | (1) Whenever an application of a retail food store or wholesale food concern to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program is denied pursuant to section 2018 of this title, or a retail food store or wholesale food concern is disqualified or subjected to a civil money penalty under the provisions of section 2021 of this title, or a retail food store or wholesale food concern forfeits a bond under section 2021(d) of this title, or all or part of any claim of a retail food store or wholesale food concern is denied under the provisions of section 2022 of this title, or a claim against a State agency is stated pursuant to the provisions of section 2022 of this title, notice of such administrative action shall be issued to the retail food store, wholesale food concern, or State agency involved.
@ref s 2023(a)(1) notice of the administrative action is issued to the retail food store, wholesale food concern or State agency involved (src:1861)
-- In plain words: when a store's or concern's application is denied, it is disqualified or fined, its bond is forfeited, or all or part of its claim is denied, notice goes to that store or concern; when a claim is stated against a State agency, notice goes to the State agency.
GIVEN `the action` IS A `s 2023(a)(1) administrative action`
      `the party involved` IS A Party
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2023(a)(1) notice of the administrative action must be issued to the party involved` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the action`
        WHEN `s 2023(a)(1) a claim against a State agency stated under section 2022` THEN
            IF `the party involved` EQUALS `the State agency` THEN JUST TRUE
            ELSE
                -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a claim against a State agency is stated pursuant to the provisions of section 2022 of this title, notice of such administrative action shall be issued to the retail food store, wholesale food concern, or State agency involved"
                NOTHING
        WHEN `s 2023(a)(1) any other action` THEN
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Whenever an application of a retail food store or wholesale food concern to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program is denied"
            NOTHING
        OTHERWISE
            IF `the party involved` EQUALS `a retail food store` OR `the party involved` EQUALS `a wholesale food concern` THEN JUST TRUE
            ELSE
                -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "notice of such administrative action shall be issued to the retail food store, wholesale food concern, or State agency involved"
                NOTHING

-- src:1862 | (2) Delivery of notices.—
-- src:1863 | A notice under paragraph (1) shall be delivered by any form of delivery that the Secretary determines will provide evidence of the delivery.
@ref s 2023(a)(2) a notice is delivered by a form of delivery the Secretary determines will provide evidence of the delivery (src:1862-1863)
GIVEN `the Secretary determines that the form of delivery will provide evidence of the delivery` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2023(a)(2) the form of delivery meets the requirement` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the Secretary determines that the form of delivery will provide evidence of the delivery`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN
            -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the Secretary has determined that the form of delivery will provide evidence of the delivery was not supplied
            NOTHING
        WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN JUST FALSE THEN
            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A notice under paragraph (1) shall be delivered by any form of delivery that the Secretary determines will provide evidence of the delivery."
            JUST FALSE

-- src:1864 | (3) If such store, concern, or State agency is aggrieved by such action, it may, in accordance with regulations promulgated under this chapter, within ten days of the date of delivery of such notice, file a written request for an opportunity to submit information in support of its position to such person or persons as the regulations may designate.
@ref s 2023(a)(3) an aggrieved store, concern or State agency may file a written request within ten days of the date of delivery of the notice (src:1864)
-- In plain words: if the store, concern or State agency is aggrieved, it may, within ten days of the date the notice was delivered, ask in writing for a chance to submit information in support of its position. The tenth day counts.
GIVEN `the store, concern, or State agency is aggrieved by the action` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date of delivery of the notice` IS A DATE
      `the date on which the written request is filed` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2023(a)(3) the written request was filed in time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the store, concern, or State agency is aggrieved by the action` THEN
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If such store, concern, or State agency is aggrieved by such action"
            NOTHING
        IF Day `the date on which the written request is filed` AT MOST Day `the date of delivery of the notice` PLUS 10 THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE
            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "within ten days of the date of delivery of such notice, file a written request for an opportunity to submit information in support of its position"
            JUST FALSE

-- src:1865 | (4) If such a request is not made or if such store, concern, or State agency fails to submit information in support of its position after filing a request, the administrative determination shall be final.
@ref s 2023(a)(4) if no request is made, or no information is submitted after a request, the administrative determination is final (src:1865)
GIVEN `a request is made` IS A BOOLEAN
      `after filing a request the store, concern, or State agency submits information in support of its position` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2023(a)(4) the administrative determination is final` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `a request is made` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF NOT `after filing a request the store, concern, or State agency submits information in support of its position` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If such a request is not made or if such store, concern, or State agency fails to submit information in support of its position after filing a request, the administrative determination shall be final."
            -- note (the determination reviewed on the information is dealt with in paragraph (5))
            NOTHING

-- src:1866 | (5) If such request is made by such store, concern, or State agency, such information as may be submitted by the store, concern, or State agency, as well as such other information as may be available, shall be reviewed by the person or persons designated by the Secretary, who shall, subject to the right of judicial review hereinafter provided, make a determination which shall be final and which shall take effect thirty days after the date of the delivery or service of such final notice of determination.
@ref s 2023(a)(5) when a request is made the determination is final, subject to judicial review, and takes effect thirty days after delivery or service of the final notice (src:1866)
GIVEN `a request is made` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date of the delivery or service of the final notice of determination` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 2023(a)(5) the date on which the determination takes effect` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `a request is made` THEN JUST (Date (Day `the date of the delivery or service of the final notice of determination` PLUS 30))
        OTHERWISE
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If such request is made by such store, concern, or State agency"
            NOTHING

-- src:1866 | (5) If such request is made by such store, concern, or State agency, such information as may be submitted by the store, concern, or State agency, as well as such other information as may be available, shall be reviewed by the person or persons designated by the Secretary, who shall, subject to the right of judicial review hereinafter provided, make a determination which shall be final and which shall take effect thirty days after the date of the delivery or service of such final notice of determination.
@ref s 2023(a)(5) the determination is final subject to judicial review (src:1866)
GIVEN `a request is made` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2023(a)(5) the determination made after review is final` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `a request is made` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If such request is made by such store, concern, or State agency"
            NOTHING

