`s 2023(a)(15) the court reviews the determination by` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the determination concerns a claim made pursuant to section 2025(c)` THEN `s 2023(a)(15) review on the administrative record`
        OTHERWISE `s 2023(a)(15) trial de novo`

